# Base URL for the gocha API.
#
# Leave EMPTY in development: requests then go to the Vite dev server as
# same-origin relative paths and are forwarded to the Go server by the proxy
# in vite.config.ts. This sidesteps CORS (the server sets no CORS headers).
#
# In production, serve this SPA behind the same origin as the API (or a
# reverse proxy), or set an absolute URL here once the server sends CORS.
VITE_API_URL=
